  "description": "WebGL 2 backend for Broadside in the browser (Blazor WebAssembly). Replays display lists on the GPU through a thin JavaScript layer (no third-party JavaScript): paths and glyph outlines by stencil-then-cover, strokes tessellated in .NET, clips in the stencil buffer, images as mipmapped textures; what it cannot draw is drawn by the managed software rasterizer, with a diagnostic. Runs in the browser only.",
